---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Refund Policy" description="Refund Policy of New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG.">
	
	<section class="bg-linear-to-b from-teal-950/40 via-background to-background pt-20 pb-12 text-center relative border-b border-border/40">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
				Our guidelines on refunds and cancellations for paid community workshops.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="py-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-6">
			<p>
				New Life Integration & Wellbeing Network CLG is a non-profit volunteer network. Certain motivational events (like "Wiz at Life") or leadership sessions may charge a small cost to cover venues, study booklets, and local catering.
			</p>
			
			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">1. Cancellations by Attendees</h2>
			<p>
				If you are unable to attend a registered paid workshop, please notify us at least <strong>48 hours in advance</strong> at <a href="mailto:info@newlifeintegration.ie" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@newlifeintegration.ie</a> to request a full refund or seat transfer.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground mt-4">2. Cancellations by the Organisation</h2>
			<p>
				In rare circumstances where an event must be cancelled or rescheduled due to extreme weather or facilitator availability, all registered attendees will be offered a full 100% refund or transfer to the rescheduled date.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
